<title>USA: Unapix Entertainment Inc Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Unapix Entertainment Inc Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months ended Sept. 30,</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p>Revenue				  $4,644,000	 $4,122,000</p>
<p>Net income				   19,000	     22,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common share		 $     -	     $</p>
<p>Average number of common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding		5,287,000(a)     3,664,000(a)</p>
<p>					    Nine Months ended Sept. 30,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Revenue				 $15,229,000	$12,821,000</p>
<p> Net Income				  266,000	    755,000</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		   .03		  .16</p>
<p>Average number of common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding		5,245,000(a)     7,472,000(a)</p>
<p>(a) 1996 shares do not include common equivalent shares because they do not result in dilution of the earnings per share figure; the 1995 share figure includes all outstanding warrants and options. The number of shares and net income per share for the nine months ended Sept. 30, 1995 have been restated to reflect the 5% stock dividend paid in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
